# gitleaks fingerprint allowlist.
#
# This file suppresses *specific findings* by fingerprint (one per line).
# For *patterns* or *paths*, edit .gitleaks.toml instead.
#
# How to add a fingerprint:
#   1. Run gitleaks on the offending range:
#      gitleaks detect --no-banner --redact
#   2. Copy the printed `Fingerprint:` value below.
#   3. Add a comment explaining what the finding is and why it's allowed.
#
# Format per entry:
#   # <one-line rationale>
#   <fingerprint-hash>
